sequenceDiagram
    actor Visitor
    participant UI as Next.js enquiry UI
    participant Action as Lead server action
    participant Limit as Rate limiter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / Prisma
    participant Session as Session lookup
    participant Email as Configured email adapter
    Visitor->>UI: Submit project enquiry
    UI->>Action: FormData / payload
    Action->>Limit: Check client IP
    Limit-->>Action: Allow or reject
    Action->>Action: Validate required fields
    Action->>DB: Create lead
    DB-->>Action: Lead identifier
    Action->>Session: Check current user
    opt Logged-in customer
        Session-->>Action: Customer identity
        Action->>DB: Best-effort project creation
    end
    Action->>Email: Attempt customer/admin email
    Email-->>Action: Provider result
    Action-->>UI: Success with lead ID
